      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOUIE LOU I NZ (2) has been tackling stronger company at Menangle where he has finished in the first half of the field in his three outings since a close second in a Listed race. He'll enjoy the class drop and should get his chance from the low draw. DANCE WITH CARMER (1) resumed with a nice fourth at Menangle before drawing wide and working here last week. He is building in fitness and is much better served by this draw. SOUTH SEAS ROCK NZ (7) did a good job to come from the widest barrier for third at Menangle. Won his lone attempt at this circuit and distance so looks better placed. Last-start winner MAJOR REASON (5) is first up for eight weeks but scored the last two times he raced here so deserves respect.",
